==============================================================================

Kiara is distributed together with third-party open-source components (for
example inside the Debian package or the bundled Python virtual environment).
Each such component remains under its own license and copyright. The AGPL covers
Kiara's own source code; it does not relicense these bundled dependencies.

The list below names the principal runtime dependencies grouped by license
family. It is INFORMATIONAL AND NOT EXHAUSTIVE. The authoritative, version-exact
inventory is generated from the installed environment with:

    pip install pip-licenses
    pip-licenses --format=markdown --with-urls --with-license-file \
                 --output-file THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md

